    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "reported-speech",
        "title": "Kusema walichosema wengine",
        "body": [
          "**nti** hufanya kazi kama **kwamba** ya Kiswahili. Iweke baada ya kitenzi cha kusema au kufikiri, kisha toa maneno: **Agamba nti…** (anasema kwamba…), **Bagamba nti…** (wanasema kwamba…), **Ndowooza nti…** (nadhani kwamba…).",
          "Maneno baada ya **nti** hubaki na wakati wake, kama Kiswahili: **Agamba nti ajja** ni “anasema kwamba anakuja”."
        ],
        "table": [
          [
            "Kiganda",
            "Kiswahili"
          ],
          [
            "Ngamba nti…",
            "Nasema kwamba…"
          ],
          [
            "Agamba nti…",
            "Anasema kwamba…"
          ],
